specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:1:# Implementation Plan: Diedrico Dihedral Learning MVP
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:4:**Input**: Feature specification from `/specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/spec.md`
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:10:**Core Technical Approach**: Vue.js 3 frontend with TypeScript, SVG-based 2D rendering, command pattern for undoable operations, process tree for dependency tracking, and app-shell project persistence through ProjectService/Drive ports.
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:17:**Primary Dependencies**: Vue.js 3 (Composition API), Vite  
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:18:**Storage**: App-shell ProjectPersistencePort with ProjectService/Drive adapter  
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:23:**Constraints**: Client-side geometry calculations, no backend computation, offline-capable after load  
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:24:**Scale/Scope**: MVP with 6 user stories, ~30 geometric operations, educational focus
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:101:See [data-model.md § Realization Layer Boundary](/specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/data-model.md#critical-realization-layer-boundary) for detailed examples.
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:163:**Migration**: 5-phase approach with non-breaking changes, dual storage, gradual migration, cleanup. See [refactoring-projection-plane-ownership.md](./refactoring-projection-plane-ownership.md) for detailed plan.
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:194:See [data-model.md § HingeLine](/specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/data-model.md#domain-entity-hingeline) and [data-model.md § Guide](/specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/data-model.md#domain-entity-guide) for detailed specifications.
