specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:1:# Research: Diedrico MVP Technical Decisions
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:11:2. **Graphics rendering**: SVG, Canvas API, or library (Three.js for 3D)
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:23:- **Simplicity**: For this MVP, we need only 4-5 REST endpoints (CRUD for projects). Express provides exactly what we need without ceremony
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:26:- **Performance**: For persistence-only API with low concurrency (single-user educational tool), Express performance is more than sufficient
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:29:- **Fastify**: Faster but introduces additional API concepts (schemas, plugins). Overkill for 5 endpoints serving one user at a time
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:34:- Middleware: `express.json()`, `cors()` for frontend-backend communication
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:36:- No authentication in MVP (single-user, local deployment)
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:71:- **Canvas API for 2D**: Rejected. Pixel-based rendering loses quality on zoom. Manual hit detection for 200 elements is complex. No DOM structure for accessibility.
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:76:- SVG root in `<Workspace2D>` component; D3 for zoom behavior
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:132:- **No server setup**: SQLite would require migrations, schema management. Overkill for MVP
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:155:  - Applies migrations sequentially (1.0.0 → 1.1.0 → 2.0.0)
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:157:  - MVP starts at 1.0.0; no migrations needed yet
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:165:- **SQLite**: Rejected. Adds server-side state, migrations, query complexity. Not needed for single-document storage
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:166:- **IndexedDB** (browser-local): Rejected for MVP. Requires backend for sharing/backup. Could add later as offline mode
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:167:- **Git-based storage**: Interesting for versioning but over-engineered for MVP
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:171:- Frontend `ProjectService` handles serialization/deserialization
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:1045:- **Rejected for MVP**: Over-engineered. Grid is simpler and sufficient for 200 elements.
