specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:1081:1. **Composition over Options API**: Use `<script setup>` for all components
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:1084:   - `<Workspace2D>`: Canvas only, delegates to tool components
